flowchart TD
    Start[Start Workflow] --> Init[Initialize Context]
    Init --> PhaseLoop{Phase <= 5?}
    PhaseLoop -- Yes --> CheckGate{Gate Check}
    CheckGate -- Pass --> ExecuteAgent[Execute Phase Agent]
    CheckGate -- Fail --> HandleError[Handle Error/Retry]
    HandleError --> PhaseLoop
    ExecuteAgent --> UpdateState[Update State & Events]
    UpdateState --> NextPhase[Increment Phase]
    NextPhase --> PhaseLoop
    PhaseLoop -- No --> End[End Workflow]
    
    subgraph Agent Execution
    ExecuteAgent --> LLM[Call LLM]
    LLM --> Parse[Parse Response]
    Parse --> Tools[Execute Tools]
    Tools --> Result[Return Result]
    end
